df_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>49</span><span>54</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a>；Cn 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>；REC 的模型分离见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4b22e5dfc91ce477\" href=\"?note=4b22e5dfc91ce477\" title=\"62-ex-REC-not-WKL\">62-ex-REC-not-WKL</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}RCA0\\text{-}WKL\\text{-}proper}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{RCA}_0)\\subsetneq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}RCA0\\text{-}WKL\\text{-}proper}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{RCA}_0)\\subsetneq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>包含由公理添加得出。严格性由 REC 中的无限递归二叉树无递归路径见证：它满足 RCA₀ 却违反 WKL；健全性说明 RCA₀ 不证明 WKL。没有把这个外部反模型论证写成 RCA₀ 内部证明自己的不完备性。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Example I.8.8; Remark I.10.2；纸面页 31, 36；PDF 页 49, 54。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head